# Optional. Live arrivals come from the shared CDN-cached document
# (lib/arrivals-url.ts); point this at a local copy to test without it.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ARRIVALS_URL=http://localhost:8800/arrivals.json

# Optional. Enables the opt-in Google map and Google Places search. Without
# it the app stays on MapLibre and station search only.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
# Optional. A Google Maps map ID (needed for Advanced Markers / cloud styles).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_MAP_ID=
